  "title": "Introducing the New Hexynyl Cartridge: Revolutionary Click Chemistry at Your Fingertips",
  "summary": "Kilobaser introduces the new Hexynyl Cartridge, expanding the capabilities of our benchtop DNA and RNA synthesizers to include click chemistry applications. This innovative cartridge allows researchers to incorporate terminal alkyne groups into oligonucleotides, enabling post-synthesis conjugation with azide-labeled molecules for custom modifications.",
